      <div v-else-if="catalog" class="catalog-grid"><RouterLink v-for="row in rows" :key="row.id" :to="`/shikigami/${row.id}`" class="shikigami-card"><div class="card-portrait"><img :src="portrait(row.id)" :alt="row.name"/><span class="portrait-label">式神档案</span></div><div class="card-body"><div><h3>{{ row.name }}</h3><span class="badge" :class="state(row).className">{{ state(row).text }}</span></div><dl><div><dt>样本胜率</dt><dd>{{ percent(selectedStats(row, grade).win_rate) }}</dd></div><div><dt>已观察玩家</dt><dd>{{ count(row.observed_players) }}</dd></div></dl><span class="card-link">查看式神档案 <Icon name="arrow" :size="17"/></span></div></RouterLink></div>
      <div v-else class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th class="rank-col">序</th><th>式神</th><th>样本胜率</th><th>新增场数</th><th>观察玩家<span class="column-hint" title="近 7 天该式神的去重玩家数，不随段位筛选变化"> ⓘ</span></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(row, index) in rows" :key="row.id"><td class="rank-col">{{ String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0') }}</td><td><RouterLink :to="`/shikigami/${row.id}`" class="name-cell"><img :src="portrait(row.id)" alt=""/><div><strong>{{ row.name }}</strong><span class="badge" :class="state(row).className">{{ state(row).text }}</span></div></RouterLink></td><td><strong class="rate" :class="{ 'no-rate': selectedStats(row, grade).win_rate === null }">{{ percent(selectedStats(row, grade).win_rate) }}</strong><span class="cell-caption">{{ selectedStats(row, grade).win_rate === null ? '尚无有效样本' : '观察区间推算' }}</span></td><td class="numeric">{{ count(selectedStats(row, grade).sample_games) }}</td><td class="numeric">{{ count(row.observed_players) }}</td><td><RouterLink class="row-arrow" :to="`/shikigami/${row.id}`" :aria-label="`查看${row.name}详情`"><Icon name="arrow" :size="17"/></RouterLink></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
      <div class="table-foot"><Icon name="info" :size="15"/><span>新增场数为所选段位的有效胜场与负场之和；“—”表示暂无胜率样本。序号仅表示展示顺序。</span></div>
    </section>
    <aside v-if="!catalog" class="right-rail"><section class="panel coverage-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>采集进展</h2><RouterLink to="/observations" class="subtle-link" aria-label="查看采集概览"><Icon name="arrow" :size="17"/></RouterLink></div><div class="coverage-summary"><strong>{{ covered.length }}<small>/{{ records.length }}</small></strong><span>式神已有观察记录</span></div><div class="progress-track"><span :style="{ width: `${records.length ? covered.length / records.length * 100 : 0}%` }"></span></div><div class="coverage-list"><div v-for="row in records" :key="row.id"><span class="mini-icon" :class="{ done: BigInt(row.observation_count) > 0n }"><Icon :name="BigInt(row.observation_count) > 0n ? 'check' : 'clock'" :size="13"/></span><strong>{{ row.name }}</strong><span>{{ BigInt(row.observation_count) > 0n ? `${count(row.observation_count)} 条观察` : '等待采集' }}</span></div></div><p class="small-note">展示数据库已保存的记录。当前尚未开启定时采集。</p></section><section class="method-card"><span class="eyebrow dark">一份数据，一份依据</span><h3>先有观察，<br/>再谈胜率。</h3><p>首次记录建立基线。再次观察到积分与胜场的变化，才能形成可计算的样本。</p><RouterLink to="/method">数据如何计算 <Icon name="arrow" :size="16"/></RouterLink><span class="method-decoration" aria-hidden="true">录</span></section></aside>
  </div>
  <div v-if="!catalog" class="bottom-note"><span class="note-mark">知</span><p><strong>样本所见，并非全部。</strong> 百炼榜只覆盖部分玩家；式神样本胜率供观察参考，不等同于全服胜率。</p><RouterLink to="/method">查看统计口径 <Icon name="chevron" :size="15"/></RouterLink></div>
</template>
